EXT. ALPINE GONDOLA CABLE CAR - HIGH ABOVE A GORGE - DUSK

A steel cabin hangs from a single cable. Beneath: a thousand feet of air and a river like a silver thread. The cable runs taut toward a far station that never seems to arrive. Wind. Ice on the glass.

INT. GONDOLA CABIN - CONTINUOUS

Four people in a space built for ten. They have been here five hours.

AUGUSTIN LEFEBVRE-MBAYE, 60s, retired cartographer, wool coat buttoned to the neck, sits in the corner with a thermos, perfectly still. Opposite him, ROSALIE TANNENBAUM, 30s, a nurse in a puffy yellow jacket, rubs her hands together and breathes into her cupped palms.

On the floor: KIERAN SZYMANSKI, 20s, backpacker, his leg splinted with a ski pole and a scarf, jaw clenched. At the window, JASMINE BEAUCHAMP-IYER, 40s, in a business suit and sneakers, pounds on the glass with her fist, then stops, then pounds again.

The cabin sways. Ice cracks. A slow groan runs down the cable.

JASMINE
Anyone else hear that?

AUGUSTIN
It is the cable.

JASMINE
The cable is groaning.

AUGUSTIN
It has been groaning for five hours.

ROSALIE
(to Kieran)
Does it hurt?

KIERAN
Only when I breathe.

ROSALIE
Then breathe shallow.

KIERAN
Thanks, doc.

ROSALIE
Nurse.

KIERAN
Thanks, nurse.

Jasmine slumps against the window. Her breath fogs the glass. She traces a line with her finger, then wipes it away.

JASMINE
The signal's dead. The radio's dead. The cable is the only thing alive.

AUGUSTIN
There is the thermos.

He unscrews it. Pours a capful of steaming tea. Holds it out to Kieran. Kieran takes it. Sips. Passes it to Rosalie. She sips. Passes it to Jasmine. She hesitates. Then drinks.

The cabin lurches. A long metallic shriek. Everyone grabs a rail.

ROSALIE
Oh, God.

AUGUSTIN
Be calm.

KIERAN
Is it dropping?

JASMINE
It's swinging.

The cabin sways wider, wider, a pendulum in the dark. Then slowly, painfully, it steadies. Far below, a river laughs.

AUGUSTIN
(quietly)
The map of this gorge was my last. I measured it in 1974. I always wondered what it looked like from here.

He pours another capful. Raises it.

AUGUSTIN (CONT'D)
To the view.

Nobody answers. Then Rosalie lifts her hand. Then Kieran. Then Jasmine.

They drink.
